      ],
      "text": "The repository contains a design RFC (status: Design RFC) scoped to Codemini CLI / WebUI / Agent Runtime, proposing a memory subsystem with SQLite FTS5 + BM25 as default retrieval and embeddings explicitly optional."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_981fd41c2f871b8eeca1d771e0087c16c838d49219bab39635015a7dcfd6921c",
