          "git_sha": "8a2c1603f58be95e15a13d5ddb4153fc249b1bf3",
          "line_end": 20,
          "line_start": 17,
          "path": "codemini-memory-2.1-design.md",
          "repository": "havingautism/codemini-cli",
          "url": "https://github.com/havingautism/Codemini-CLI/blob/3e3a6665c9d2a53e69d0259172e335f4b60f2e60/codemini-memory-2.1-design.md#L17-L20"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_9003bc5b25a930cfcfd00d4f9ecf2210d48e187710184959230af2420045c0fd"
      ],
      "text": "The design targets four goals: cross-session memory, task-relevant recall rather than stuffing all memory into the prompt, learning reusable engineering experience from failure-to-verification cycles, and long-term governance (dedup, expiry, conflict handling, eviction)."
    },
